{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫處境劇《愛‧回家之三代同糖》今晚（19日）播出最新一集「得而復失三千萬」，劇情令觀眾覺得似曾相識。</p><p>早前有一班同事夾錢買六合彩中頭獎，豈料負責落注的人領取巨額彩金後，疑要求「佔大份」遭拒，隨後連日沒上班兼失去聯絡，事件在網上瘋傳後，引發軒然大波。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T07:19:14.710423+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":125,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T06:27:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T08:17:44.994052+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T07:17:39.540777+00:00","content_hash":"92c0d5db3a8b2b0cf08e26228fbcdd1af585709116b1d09d50abed947735f3c0","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}